__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.txt
!requirements.txt
*.json
!package.json
.venv/
venv/
*.log

# Run artifacts. A HAR records full request AND response headers — session
# cookies included — alongside real campaign IDs and publisher URLs. This repo
# is a public portfolio with client names deliberately scrubbed; committing a
# single artifact would undo that and leak credentials with it.
core/artifacts/
# Belt and braces: anchored patterns miss a nested copy, and a run
# started from another working directory would land in one.
**/artifacts/
screenshots/
*.har
*.xlsx
*.xls
report_*.html

# Test fixtures are the one exception: sanitized HARs, committed on purpose so
# the analyzer has regression coverage. Sanitize with tools/sanitize_har.py —
# never hand-copy a raw run artifact in here.
!core/tests/fixtures/*.har

# Persistent browser profile used by watch mode — contains real cookies.
core/profile_data/

# Campaign inputs (trafficking sheets, pasted emails)
data/

# Model credentials. GEMINI_API_KEY lives here and on the server only —
# never in frontend/index.html, which is a static file in a public repo.
.env
.env.*
